# What the shared .NET rules put into a repository.
# See core/manifest.list for the format and the modes.
#
# This is not a stack pack. It cannot be picked with --stack; the dotnet-core
# and dotnet-legacy packs pull it in through a `+shared/dotnet` line in their
# own manifest.list.

AGENTS.dotnet.md|AGENTS.dotnet.md|managed
editorconfig.block|.editorconfig|block:devkit:shared/dotnet
gitignore.block|.gitignore|block:devkit:shared/dotnet
